# Grab & Go mobile
#
# Expo exposes EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables to the app bundle. These are public by
# definition — never put a secret here.
#
# Defaults come from app.json's `extra` block, which points at localhost. Set
# these when running on a physical device (use your machine's LAN IP, because a
# phone cannot reach the laptop's localhost) or against a deployed API.

# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:4000/api/v1
# EXPO_PUBLIC_REALTIME_URL=http://192.168.1.10:4000

# --- Map --------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The map uses MapLibre GL with OpenFreeMap tiles (OpenStreetMap data).
# No access token or API key is required.
#
# The app renders its own branded style, authored in
# src/map/grabgo-style.ts. Set this to bypass it and point at any other
# MapLibre-compatible style URL instead.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL=https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/liberty
